        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: United States Auto Club, WC Vision\n- Events: 1991 USAC FF2000 Championship, United States National Championship, Indianapolis 500, Pirelli World Challenge\n- Places: California, Arizona\n\nFacts:\n- From 1956 to 1979, the United States Auto Club sanctioned the United States National Championship.\n- From 1956 to 1997, the United States Auto Club sanctioned the Indianapolis 500.\n- The 1991 USAC FF2000 Championship series was sanctioned by the United States Auto Club.\n- The 1991 USAC FF2000 Championship ran races in California and Arizona.\n- Since 2008, WC Vision has managed the Pirelli World Challenge.\n- Since 2017, the United States Auto Club has sanctioned the Pirelli World Challenge.",
